OL,3,AHeathrow third runway plans 'should be
OL,4,Agrounded'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has "failed to make the
OL,7,Fcase" for Heathrow Airport's expansion,
OL,8,Fthe chair of the Transport Committee
OL,9,Fhas said, as a highly anticipated
OL,10,Freport on the #33bn project is
OL,11,Fpublished.
OL,13,FRuth Cadbury said the draft Heathrow
OL,14,FExpansion National Policy Statement did
OL,15,Fnot adequately address noise, air
OL,16,Fpollution and climate tests.
OL,18,F"Plans for a third runway should be
OL,19,Fgrounded for now and the government
OL,20,Fshould go back to the drawing board,"
OL,21,Fshe said.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
